<title>USA: Cityscape to offer $300 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>Cityscape to offer $300 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>ELMSFORD, N.Y. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cityscape Financial Corp said on Monday it is offering in a private placement $300 million in aggregate principal amount of its senior notes due 2004.</p>
<p>The notes are noncallable for four years, the company said.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering, which is scheduled to be completed in early May, will be used to repay debt and for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
</text>
